acceptance.evidence:
test/unit/packageJson.test.ts (5 tests, passing) checks:
- the 3 commands and the explorer/context menu;
- activationEvents equal [workspaceContains:**/.telelean/config.json, onWebviewPanel:telelean.board];
- untrustedWorkspaces.supported false, virtualWorkspaces false;
- the 6 settings with defaults 4, 2, true, 750, true, 'git', matching SETTING_DEFAULTS;
- 6 colour ids, each with exactly one dot, hex defaults for dark/light/highContrast/highContrastLight, no charts.*.
The smoke activation suite confirms the same as VS Code reads it.

model.test.ts ran against the REAL runner and core code of WP1–WP4 as it stood at 12:40, before the integrator's integration. All passed in runs 3, 4 and 5:
- 4 cards;
- after refresh: semantic fresh and 9 vocabulary items (real lake build under runLean in the scratch copy);
- addNode writes Model/Spyro/Inbox.lean, and undo restores it;
- G->A on cynder-not-good writes `axiom cynder_not_good.holds`, and the refresh shows it assumed;
- copyText reaches env.clipboard.readText;
- initGit, historyList (storage > 0), historyPreview (diff tab) and historyRevert plus its undo all work; refs are refs/telelean/* only, with no HEAD commit and a clean index;
- openInEditor opens Main.lean;
- .telelean/graph.json exists with format telelean-graph.
The integrator should re-run it after integration.

After each run smoke.mjs reports:
- the isolated user-data dir received 121 entries;
- the real ~/.copilot, ~/.config/Code (top level and logs/), ~/.config/google-chrome (top level and Crash Reports) and ~/.local/share/Trash/files are unchanged;
- no process containing the profile path is left, and no new telelean-* unit;
- in-instance test: HOME, XDG_*, GIT_CONFIG_GLOBAL and the settings are isolated.
Verified by hand as well: no VS Code sockets or xvfb dirs left from my runs, and ~/.elan/known-projects unchanged (mtime 09:09).

80/80 vitest tests:
- every mutating protocol type mapped to a BoardAction (actionMapping.test.ts);
- FileChange to minimal edits, incl. a 300-round random round-trip with CRLF, and positions (editApplier.test.ts);
- the EditApplier refuses stale `before`, create-over-existing, outside-root and duplicate paths, an editor refusal and a failed save, and applies nothing;
- TextSource prefers open documents, returns null for missing files, strips a BOM, refuses outside paths;
- openInEditor refuses outside paths and outside-pointing links (modelPaths.test.ts);
- actionResult/notice posting with and without requestId, needs-confirmation, not-yet, undo/redo, ordering;
- a vanished subject switches the board (boardSession.test.ts);
- the bundle loads with a vscode stub and contains no llm/ modules (bundle.test.ts).

